Bonus chart: Diesel hits record high
 
 By Emily Peck 
 &nbsp; 
 
 Data: FactSet; Note: NY Harbor ultra-low sulfur; Chart: Emily Peck/Axios The market for diesel fuel is feeling the energy squeeze most acutely. Diesel is a key input for just about anything grown or transported through the U.S.

 And the price of benchmark diesel futures is sitting at an all-time high of $4.73 per gallon.


 
 
